WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:10.210
One satellite pass, different band times. A thin airborne feature appears differently across Sentinel-2 bands near Öckerö.

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:19.170
Detector rows record the scene at different times. Moving and elevated features can shift between bands.

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:25.090
The existing band animation makes the differences easier to inspect.

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:34.810
The feature and band offsets are observable. Aircraft identity and motion require independent confirmation.
